#: 09966ed8e39a46b1b7ad64dcc0d05736
msgid "An example of lane switching for a plane with 2 airspeed sensors and airspeed affinity enabled. There are 2 IMUs, hence 2 active lanes. The primary lane's airspeed sensor has failed to show changes in pressure, hence reporting a constant value. The speed of the plane is increased and a lane switch occurs. Similarly, the second airspeed sensor of the second lane (now the primary lane) is failed and the plane's speed is decreased which again triggers a lane switch."
msgstr ""

