msgid "MAGNETOMETER"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching.rst:96
#: c3abcdf64ebd41f48bea8dfe5e866e3a
msgid "An example of lane switching for a plane with 2 Magnetometers and magnetometer affinity enabled. There are 2 IMUs, hence 2 active lanes. An error is simulated in the primary lane's magnetometer by changing the offset of the z-axis while flying. The offset change can be tracked with the 2nd magnetometer. Subsequently, the EKF primary lane starts reporting a consistently high error and a lane switch occurs when the error crosses the set threshold."
msgstr ""
